{"event": "token", "client_s": 5.804, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 28, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:34:58.600Z", "t_ms": 5748, "delta": "e.g., chain-of-thought traces) and acting (e.g., action plan generation) in an"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 5.913, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:34:58.710Z", "t_ms": 5858, "delta": " interleaved manner within a closed-loop system [C1, C10]. This synergy allows reasoning traces to help the"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.068, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 30, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:34:58.864Z", "t_ms": 6012, "delta": " model induce, track, and update action plans while handling exceptions, and allows actions to interface with external environments or knowledge sources to gather real-"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.199, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 31, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:34:58.995Z", "t_ms": 6144, "delta": "time information [C1]. This approach improves task performance, grounds decision-making, and enhances human interpretability and controllability"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.374, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 32, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:34:59.171Z", "t_ms": 6320, "delta": " [C1, C3].\n\n### Method\n- **Action Space Augmentation:** ReAct expands the agent'"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.519, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 33, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:34:59.316Z", "t_ms": 6465, "delta": "s action space to $\\hat{\\mathcal{A}} = \\mathcal{A} \\cup \\mathcal{L}$, where $\\mathcal"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.72, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 34, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:34:59.511Z", "t_ms": 6660, "delta": "{L}$ represents free-form language thoughts [C2]. Thoughts do not affect the external environment or yield observation feedback; instead"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.863, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 35, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:34:59.660Z", "t_ms": 6808, "delta": ", they reason over the existing context and update the context history to guide future reasoning and actions [C2].\n-"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.978, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 36, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:34:59.774Z", "t_ms": 6923, "delta": " **Thought Types:** Language thoughts serve several roles, including decomposing high-level goals into subgoals, tracking progress, injecting"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.188, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 37, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:34:59.984Z", "t_ms": 7132, "delta": " commonsense knowledge, extracting critical observation details, and adjusting plans when encountering exceptions [C2, C7].\n- **Execution Patterns"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.344, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 38, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:35:00.139Z", "t_ms": 7288, "delta": ":** The framework primarily uses frozen LLMs (such as PaLM-540B) guided by few-shot in-"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.472, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 39, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:35:00.268Z", "t_ms": 7416, "delta": "context demonstrations [C3]. For reasoning-intensive tasks (e.g., QA and fact verification), the model alternates"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.758, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 40, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:35:00.501Z", "t_ms": 7649, "delta": " between thoughts, actions, and observations in lockstep [C3]. For long-horizon interactive decision tasks, thoughts appear"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.87, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 41, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:35:00.664Z", "t_ms": 7812, "delta": " sparsely and asynchronously when deemed necessary by the model [C3].\n\n### Results\n- **Knowledge-Intensive Reasoning"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.165, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 42, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:35:00.888Z", "t_ms": 8037, "delta": ":** On HotpotQA and Fever, ReAct interacts with a Wikipedia search API to curb the severe hallucination issues common in pure chain-of"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.233, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 43, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:35:01.001Z", "t_ms": 8150, "delta": "-thought (CoT) prompting [C1, C4, C5]. Combining ReAct with CoT with"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.414, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 44, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:35:01.197Z", "t_ms": 8345, "delta": " self-consistency (CoT-SC) achieved the highest prompting performance on both benchmarks (35.1 EM on HotpotQA and"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.543, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 45, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:35:01.338Z", "t_ms": 8487, "delta": " 64.6% accuracy on Fever) [C4, C6]. Furthermore, fine-tuning smaller models (Pa"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.711, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 46, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:35:01.480Z", "t_ms": 8629, "delta": "LM-8B and 62B) on ReAct trajectories outperformed pure prompting baselines, showing better generalization for external"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.843, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 47, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:35:01.633Z", "t_ms": 8782, "delta": " information retrieval [C6].\n- **Interactive Decision Making:** On the text-based household benchmark ALFWorld, ReAct achieved"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.971, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 48, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:35:01.757Z", "t_ms": 8905, "delta": " a best success rate of 71%, outperforming the action-only baseline (Act at 45%) and the"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.139, "data": {"request_id": "8602963c788d", "seq": 49, "ts": "2026-10-28T04:35:01.935Z", "t_ms": 9083, "delta": " imitation-learning agent BUTLER (37%) [C8, C9]. On the WebShop e-commerce environment,"}}
